TITLE:: ArrangerView
SUMMARY:: Placeholder view for the SequencerGui Arrange page.
CATEGORIES:: Streams-Patterns-Events
RELATED:: Classes/SequencerGui, Classes/SCViewHolder

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::ArrangerView:: is a LINK::Classes/SCViewHolder:: that LINK::Classes/SequencerGui:: shows when the Arrange button is pressed. It currently displays placeholder text while the arrangement interface is redesigned.

